  "annotations": [
    [
      "006bd930",
      "cm0102_check_period_boundary",
      "Helper enum 0..4 is distinct from dispatcher statuses. Targets495/990/1155/1320 \u003d45/90/105/120 minutes*11. Normal expiry is strictly clock\u003etarget+signed-byte allowance. Rule-bit names and early-stop semantics remain partly unverified."
    ],
    [
      "006be710",
      "cm0102_advance_tiebreak_sequence",
      "Special phases1/2/3 and4/5/6 are init/attempt/finish triplets, five attempts per side and sudden-death behavior. Ordinary-penalty versus US-style mapping is not yet established."
    ],
    [
      "006d6f70",
      "cm0102_enqueue_commentary_event",
      "Builds a14-byte event, queues in12-entry ring and copies into capped700-record history. Detailed-mode minute is uint8(trunc(signed16(clock)/11)); nonzero-mode takes low clock byte. Timestamp code slice checked exhaustively across signed16 inputs in modes0/1/255."
    ],
    [
      "006d1210",
      "cm0102_process_auxiliary_event_candidate",
      "Called when match+8EB4\u003d\u003d1 and for selected slot events. Full meaning remains unresolved."
    ],
    [
      "006b98c0",
      "cm0102_advance_match_candidate",
      "ABI correction: stack work argument and status are bytes. -1 supplies255 charged work units. Some loop paths consume no work unit, so no fixed255-iteration/runtime bound. Return1 yields,2 finalises,4 phase-yields,8 exceptional terminal path."
    ]
  ],
